## Getting Started

1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   {{#if (eq packageManager "npm")}}npm install{{/if}}{{#if (eq packageManager "yarn")}}yarn{{/if}}{{#if (eq packageManager "pnpm")}}pnpm install{{/if}}
   ```

2. Start the development server:
   ```bash
   {{#if (eq packageManager "npm")}}npm run dev{{/if}}{{#if (eq packageManager "yarn")}}yarn dev{{/if}}{{#if (eq packageManager "pnpm")}}pnpm dev{{/if}}
   ```

3. Open [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173) in your browser.

## Available Scripts

- `dev` - Start development server
- `build` - Build for production
- `preview` - Preview production build locally
{{#if options.devTools.includeESLint}}
- `lint` - Run ESLint
{{/if}}

